omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2mtLnhzDsbgQ7kNvwEzq9Hn&_nc_oc=AdqhZi6otNOPicvMCMZmUDLzfASRlAjnVpp7ZUXbq8G-ZuW0HC4WmpGNkVLdXeyot6g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx7TJWrOx2jgn13g5Effv_XTw0sNdSimCcgHJKSRrcjGg&oe=69D0F474"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Joqy5EcYSJgQ7kNvwFrfY_t&_nc_oc=Adp4HLlNTX1moxfT2_CroO83cGNKbp2k0K-R1Ho21nbr-l9L4TFW-l9jHMAzx7pagA8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afwm5RvXroIZgDNQxRNg5_nDDwuf_VTGgaocm5Xbj6VwWQ&oe=69D0F5D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2TBOi50SgTUQ7kNvwGZx4Bp&_nc_oc=Adrb8ngxPkeJRndANOvrguo0kIREzKqHSuVZNGXAUqxTQHN8Zs_wAiZJVY5370J0KsA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyllI5XhD5MvqxP9ZD-n7Xyi_kC9eoCJe21aBXbbkYghw&oe=69D10AF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://